  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero maximum HP +4 per talent.
    Each 8 team kills gives this ally 1% attack speed, up to 15% this wave.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Attack range: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA timekeeper whose heart stayed punctual after the trains
    stopped, they falsified bells to give stranded children hope. Admitting the lie
    cost their post. They want to ring for an arrival they have actually witnessed.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s, chill enemies within 2.313 units: 1.5s normally, 0.6s on bosses.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: clock, rune, mask. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
